{"title":"Career Roadmap · Environmental Planner","role":"Environmental Planner","summary":"An Environmental Planner integrates environmental science, landscape planning, urban planning, ecology, infrastructure, and spatial analysis to guide development while protecting natural systems and improving environmental resilience.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Arch (Bachelor of Architecture)","Course":"Landscape Architecture"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Environmental Planner integrates environmental science, landscape planning, urban planning, ecology, infrastructure, and spatial analysis to guide development while protecting natural systems and improving environmental resilience."},{"type":"p","text":"The role operates between planning, architecture, landscape, ecology, geography, infrastructure, and environmental management."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental planning"},{"text":"Land-use planning"},{"text":"Landscape planning"},{"text":"Ecological planning"},{"text":"Green infrastructure"},{"text":"Watershed planning"},{"text":"Environmental impact assessment"},{"text":"Climate-resilient planning"},{"text":"Urban environmental management"},{"text":"Biodiversity-sensitive development"},{"text":"Wetland and riverfront planning"},{"text":"Coastal/environmental planning"},{"text":"Open-space systems"},{"text":"Ecological restoration"},{"text":"Environmental policy and planning support"},{"text":"GIS-based environmental analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architecture","Landscape","Ecology","GIS","Environmental Planning","Data"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Arch + Foundation"},{"text":"Landscape, ecology, GIS, environmental analysis"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Environmental Planner / Planning Analyst"},{"text":"Environmental assessments, spatial planning, green infrastructure"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Environmental Planner"},{"text":"Regional planning, climate resilience, ecological planning"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Environmental Planning Leadership"},{"text":"Large-scale environmental policy, regional strategy, sustainable development"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Arch","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Landscape + Environmental Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an understanding of the relationship between built environments and natural systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural design"},{"text":"Landscape fundamentals"},{"text":"Site planning"},{"text":"Environmental studies"},{"text":"Ecology fundamentals"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Site analysis"},{"text":"Climate-responsive design"},{"text":"Landform"},{"text":"Vegetation"},{"text":"Water systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to analyze"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Topography"},{"text":"Soil"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Vegetation"},{"text":"Water bodies"},{"text":"Climate"},{"text":"Sun"},{"text":"Wind"},{"text":"Existing development"},{"text":"Natural habitats"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Landscape Architecture + Ecology"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop stronger landscape and ecological design capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Landscape skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landscape planning"},{"text":"Planting design"},{"text":"Hardscape"},{"text":"Softscape"},{"text":"Grading"},{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Irrigation"},{"text":"Open-space planning"},{"text":"Parks"},{"text":"Streetscapes"},{"text":"Urban plazas"},{"text":"Green corridors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ecology"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ecosystems"},{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Habitat"},{"text":"Ecological succession"},{"text":"Soil systems"},{"text":"Watersheds"},{"text":"Wetlands"},{"text":"Riparian systems"},{"text":"Urban ecology"},{"text":"Human–environment interaction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — GIS & Spatial Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"GIS should become one of the most important technical skills in this career."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"QGIS"},{"text":"ArcGIS"},{"text":"OpenStreetMap"},{"text":"Satellite imagery"},{"text":"Remote sensing fundamentals"},{"text":"Digital elevation models"},{"text":"Land-use mapping"},{"text":"Land-cover classification"},{"text":"Spatial analysis"},{"text":"Buffer analysis"},{"text":"Overlay analysis"},{"text":"Suitability analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical environmental planning workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Satellite / GIS Data","Land Use / Land Cover","Topography","Hydrology","Vegetation","Infrastructure","Population / Development","Environmental Constraints","Suitability Analysis","Planning Alternatives","Preferred Environmental Plan"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Environmental Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from individual sites toward larger spatial systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Land-use planning"},{"text":"Regional planning"},{"text":"Urban environmental planning"},{"text":"Environmental zoning"},{"text":"Development suitability"},{"text":"Carrying capacity"},{"text":"Ecological networks"},{"text":"Green infrastructure"},{"text":"Blue infrastructure"},{"text":"Watershed planning"},{"text":"Open-space systems"},{"text":"Disaster-risk planning"},{"text":"Climate adaptation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Planning scale"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand multiple scales:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Building","Site","Neighbourhood","City","Watershed","Region","Landscape / Ecosystem"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Environmental Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Environmental planners should understand how proposed development affects environmental systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental Impact Assessment"},{"text":"Environmental management"},{"text":"Environmental baseline studies"},{"text":"Impact identification"},{"text":"Mitigation planning"},{"text":"Environmental monitoring"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Cumulative impacts"},{"text":"Environmental management plans"},{"text":"Stakeholder consultation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A planner does not simply ask:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Can we build here?\""},{"type":"p","text":"The better question is:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"What development is appropriate here, under what environmental conditions, and how can its impacts be minimized?\""},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Climate & Resilience Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop specialization in environmental resilience."},{"type":"h","text":"Study"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate change adaptation"},{"text":"Urban heat"},{"text":"Flood risk"},{"text":"Drought"},{"text":"Water scarcity"},{"text":"Stormwater"},{"text":"Coastal vulnerability"},{"text":"Landslide risk"},{"text":"Disaster resilience"},{"text":"Heat mitigation"},{"text":"Blue-green infrastructure"},{"text":"Nature-based solutions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental Planning Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental Baseline","Site / Regional Analysis","GIS Mapping","Ecological Assessment","Land-Use Analysis","Environmental Constraints","Development Opportunities","Impact Assessment","Alternative Scenarios","Mitigation Strategies","Green / Blue Infrastructure","Climate Resilience","Environmental Management Plan","Monitoring & Evaluation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Knowledge Areas"}]},{"heading":"Landscape Architecture","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site planning"},{"text":"Landscape design"},{"text":"Planting"},{"t