},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental Planning Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong planner should be able to create:"},{"type":"h","text":"Land Suitability Analysis"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Slope"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Flood Risk"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Soil"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Vegetation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Water"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Existing Land Use","Weighted Overlay","Environmental Suitability Map"]},{"type":"h","text":"Green Infrastructure Network"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wetlands"},{"text":"↕"},{"text":"River"},{"text":"↕"},{"text":"Urban Parks"},{"text":"↕"},{"text":"Green Corridors"},{"text":"↕"},{"text":"Street Trees"},{"text":"↕"},{"text":"Neighbourhood Open Spaces"},{"text":"The objective is to think of green spaces as an interconnected environmental system, not isolated parks."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Urban Green Infrastructure Plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a city-scale green infrastructure strategy."},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Existing parks"},{"text":"Water bodies"},{"text":"Urban forests"},{"text":"Heat islands"},{"text":"Flood-prone areas"},{"text":"Green corridors"},{"text":"Then develop a connected ecological network."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Riverfront Environmental Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop an environmentally sensitive riverfront strategy."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Floodplain analysis"},{"text":"Riparian vegetation"},{"text":"Public access"},{"text":"Biodiversity"},{"text":"Water quality"},{"text":"Stormwater"},{"text":"Ecological restoration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Climate-Resilient Neighbourhood"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a neighbourhood responding to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Heat"},{"text":"Flooding"},{"text":"Water scarcity"},{"text":"Extreme rainfall"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Integrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parks"},{"text":"Bioswales"},{"text":"Rain gardens"},{"text":"Permeable surfaces"},{"text":"Urban forests"},{"text":"Water retention"},{"text":"Shaded streets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Watershed Management Plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Map a watershed and create an environmental planning strategy."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drainage"},{"text":"Slope"},{"text":"Soil"},{"text":"Land use"},{"text":"Water bodies"},{"text":"Development"},{"text":"Erosion"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then develop:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Conservation","Restoration","Development Zones"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Ecological Restoration Plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a degraded landscape and develop a restoration strategy."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible sites:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban lake"},{"text":"Wetland"},{"text":"River corridor"},{"text":"Quarry"},{"text":"Degraded urban land"},{"text":"Forest edge"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize organizations where you can work with actual spatial/environmental datasets."},{"type":"h","text":"High-value internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental planning consultancy"},{"text":"Landscape architecture firm"},{"text":"Urban planning consultancy"},{"text":"Environmental consultancy"},{"text":"GIS consultancy"},{"text":"Environmental Impact Assessment firm"},{"text":"Urban development authority"},{"text":"Municipal corporation"},{"text":"Watershed management organization"},{"text":"Climate resilience consultancy"},{"text":"Ecological restoration organization"},{"text":"Smart-city / urban analytics organization"},{"text":"Research institute"},{"text":"Sustainability consultancy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental Planning Intern"},{"text":"Landscape Architecture Intern"},{"text":"GIS In